ject":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"The final plan review passed and signed. The E6 advisory proposed either mechanical README string checks or an explicit manual comparison. Mechanical prose enforcement is outside the approved scope. The plan records manual comparison against the five named behavior suites, and that comparison will be documented at completion. The minor compound-criterion advisory is accepted because each paired phrase describes one coherent documentation contract.","timestamp":1787476435637348001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implementation is committed as dbf351c3fea200c665e777bc3ba081ed3ebbc2b0 on origin/main base 7e2e6afb27. D1 through D4 passed. The shared docs-only lane passed with 3158 tests and 15 skips. ADR, index, environment registry, CLI reference, MCP reference, DCO identity, criteria vocabulary, merge-conflict, large-file, whitespace, and commit-ticket checks passed. The full test suite was omitted by operator direction. Gerrit push is next.","timestamp":1787477258431823001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F08A CI completed successfully.\n\nCI_RESULT\n\n{\"run_id\":\"32631071840\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"duration\":310,\"fixes_applied\":[],\"retry_count\":0}\n\nGerrit change 2155 is submittable at dbf351c3fea200c665e777bc3ba081ed3ebbc2b0. LLM-Review is +1, Verified is +1, and the unresolved comment count is zero. Submission is next.","timestamp":1787477650853722001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit change 2155 merged as dbf351c3fea200c665e777bc3ba081ed3ebbc2b0, which is now origin/main. CI run 32631071840 passed. Manual comparison confirmed that README claim guidance matches tests/unit/test_claim_default_assignee.py, relation guidance matches tests/interfaces/contracts/test_event_schema_relations.py, unlink guidance matches tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_unlink_relation_scoped_e39f.py, help guidance matches tests/interfaces/contracts/test_create_help_no_write_b8de.py, and close guidance matches tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_completion_gate.py. The implementation changes only README.md and leaves the demonstration asset and unrelated sections unchanged.","timestamp":1787478483185346001}],"created_at":1787417145184816001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d30bd846-2a63-4310-b6f0-e2f043776c95","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"65c9-aba3-c744-483a"},{"link_uuid":"ba9d5990-d4ec-43b7-aca8-6b325ae3cc67","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"56c2-71b4-a72e-46be"}],"description":"## Context\nREADME workflow prose conflicts with current claim, graph, help, and close behavior. The dispatcher fix on `chartreuse-interested-viper`, the assignee correction on `weariless-scrapable-mouse`, the quickstart work on `tsunamic-wax-hog`, and ADR 0100 define the historical basis. F12 completed command discovery before this story finalized help wording.\n\n## Plan\n- Document default claim assignment and Jira-resolvable explicit overrides.\n- Name all seven relations, including `caused_by`.\n- Document optional relation-scoped unlink.\n- Describe help recognition before `--` while preserving nested `bridge` and `audit` handling.\n- Describe integrated completion verification for task, bug, story, and epic closes as an optional gate that is disabled by default and enabled with `verify.require_completion_verification_for_close`.\n- Preserve the tested quickstart and existing README structure.\n- Compare README wording against the behavior exercised by `tests/unit/test_claim_default_assignee.py`, `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_event_schema_relations.py`, `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_unlink_relation_scoped_e39f.py`, `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_create_help_no_write_b8de.py`, and `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_completion_gate.py`.\n- Leave demonstration assets for F16.\n\n## Verification\n- D1 runs `python scripts/check_docs_index.py --check`.\n- D2 runs `python scripts/check_readme_quickstart.py`.\n- D3 runs `python -m pytest tests/scripts/test_check_readme_quickstart.py -q`.\n- D4 runs `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_claim_default_assignee.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_event_schema_relations.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_unlink_relation_scoped_e39f.py tests/interfaces/contracts/test_create_help_no_write_b8de.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_completion_gate.py -q`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Generic claim guidance omits an explicit assignee and explains valid overrides.\n- [x] Link guidance names all seven relations.\n- [x] Unlink guidance documents omitted and explicit relation behavior.\n- [x] Help guidance matches leaf and nested command behavior.\n- [x] Close guidance states that ordinary work-ticket completion verification is optional, disabled by default, and enabled with `verify.require_completion_verification_for_close`.\n- [x] The recorded D1 through D4 verification commands pass.\n- [x] No demonstration asset or unrelated README section changes.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"README.md","reason":"Correct workflow, relation, help, claim, and close guidance."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["depends_on","65c9-aba3-c744-483a"],["parent","f7e4-4d33-f231-4774"],["relates_to","56c2-71b4-a72e-46be"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"f7e4-4d33-f231-4774","parent_status_uuid":"eb758ee1-c96c-40e8-8c16-448789309b6a","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["documentation","f08a"],"ticket_